  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "预告片期待值第一  (Number One in Audience Anticipation)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Fresh back at Xingtian after wrapping the overseas shoot, Kaiwen greets Xingzi at her desk and asks how their first trailer performed at home. Listen to their Mandarin banter.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你第一天认识我啊？上了班当然得化妆抹粉底。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "看你这次战功赫赫，我今天就不跟你吵了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷没去欧洲，你那个购物清单我就给你要过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我在百忙之中争分夺秒，一趟一趟全给你买齐了，够意思吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "东西在哪儿呢？明天上班记得给我带过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "快说说，咱们节目在国内有没有反响？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "魅力远航的第一支预告片已经放出来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "根据粉团科技昨天的数据，观众期待值排名第一！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "太棒了，不枉费我们在欧洲大战三百回合！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大亲自带队，片子做得这么好，我一点都不意外。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你是不知道，扛摄像机真能把人累坏了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你第一天认识我啊？上了班当然得化妆抹粉底。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you meet me yesterday? Coming to work, of course I put on foundation and makeup.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "看你这次战功赫赫，我今天就不跟你吵了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seeing all the glory you earned on this shoot, I will spare you an argument today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷没去欧洲，你那个购物清单我就给你要过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since Xiaogu did not go to Europe, I got your shopping list from her instead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我在百忙之中争分夺秒，一趟一趟全给你买齐了，够意思吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the middle of our hectic shoot I raced the clock trip after trip to buy everything for you—pretty loyal, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "东西在哪儿呢？明天上班记得给我带过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are the things? Remember to bring them to me at work tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "快说说，咱们节目在国内有没有反响？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell me quickly—has our show gotten any buzz here at home?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "魅力远航的第一支预告片已经放出来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The very first trailer for Charming Voyage has already been released.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "根据粉团科技昨天的数据，观众期待值排名第一！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'According to yesterday's data from Fentuan, viewer anticipation ranks number one!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "太棒了，不枉费我们在欧洲大战三百回合！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fantastic—all those epic battles we fought filming in Europe were not in vain!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大亲自带队，片子做得这么好，我一点都不意外。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With the boss leading the crew in person and the footage turning out so well, I am not surprised one bit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你是不知道，扛摄像机真能把人累坏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have no idea—hauling cameras around really wears a person out.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你第一天认识我啊？上了班当然得化妆抹粉底。",
      "gap": 0.5
